metric may be called `better`.\n261:- **Noise bands** (`--noise`): an A-versus-A record is used only if it matches the comparison's workload, parameters,\n284:## Two builds and screening (plan 6)\n288:whose harness files (page, adapters) differ, so only the library differs. `--screen --tolerance <t>` applies the\n291:change (exit code 3, `<run id>.screening.json`). Tolerances are to be declared per workload before measuring (plan\n292:5); none are declared yet, so `--tolerance` is required. Not built: the nightly reference-machine confirmation, the\n310:- No traces: presentation time, GPU and raster time, Long Animation Frames are not measured; P3 and P4 are frame\n312:- Readiness comes from each library's hooks; screenshot validation is not implemented.\n321:- At 230×115 tiles Axylo drew no marks (L8 fallback), and the M1 dashboard records drew none either (above).\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
